@startuml
title SSD US008 - Register a new city

actor Administrator
participant "MiteLovers" as System

Administrator -> System: Select "Register city"
System --> Administrator: Show city registration form\n(with countries list)

Administrator -> System: Submit city data\n(cityName, countryId)
activate System

System -> System: Validate mandatory fields + format
System -> System: Check country exists
System -> System: Check duplicates (cityName + country)
System -> System: Register city in the system
System --> Administrator: Done!

deactivate System
@enduml